  "headline": "Valacyclovir hydrochloride is not on FDA's shortage list as of 2026-10-21; Corvale General has 16.4 days on hand and the current label traces to a repack plant last inspected VAI 2025-09-26",
  "headline_cites": ["D2", "D1", "E7"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "FDA's drug shortage list does not include valacyclovir hydrochloride as of 2026-10-21.",
      "cites": ["D2"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale General holds 256 tablets of the 1 g presentation, which at 15.6 tablets per day provides 16.4 days on hand.",
      "cites": ["D1"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The product label (NDC 51655070304) names Northwind Health Company, LLC as the repack plant (FEI 1831143) with a last inspection classification of VAI on 2025-09-26.",
      "cites": ["E7"]
    },
    {
      "text": "FDA inspection records for FEI 1831143 show a VAI classification on 2025-09-26 (inspection 1256379) and an earlier OAI classification on 2015-12-09 (inspection 952157).",
      "cites": ["E6", "E4"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The top-ranked buying option is Aurobindo Pharma Limited, which is not on FDA's shortage list and operates three plants: APL HEALTHCARE LIMITED (VAI 2025-12-17), Aurobindo Pharma Limited (VAI 2022-05-10), and Aurolife Pharma LLC (OAI 2021-12-07).",
      "cites": ["D3"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Alternative manufacturers AvPAK and Camber Pharmaceuticals, Inc. are also not on the shortage list, but their labels name no identifiable plant.",
      "cites": ["D4", "D5"]
    }
  ]
}
